      "status": "approved",
      "text": "For positive bases, $a^ma^n=a^{m+n}$ and $a^m/a^n=a^{m-n}$."
    },
    {
      "id": "sl-1-5-ku-2",
      "status": "approved",
      "text": "Also $(a^m)^n=a^{mn}$ and $a^{-n}=1/a^n$ for $a\\ne0$."
    },
    {
      "id": "sl-1-5-ku-3",
      "status": "approved",
      "text": "$\\log_a b=c$ means $a^c=b$, with $a>0$, $a\\ne1$ and $b>0$."
    }
